WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.218
The AI only says what you have told it. The business brief is where you tell it. It takes about ten minutes, and you can change it at any time.

00:00:09.368 --> 00:00:16.069
Open Business brief in the menu. There are seven short sections down the left. You can fill them in any order.

00:00:16.219 --> 00:00:26.013
In Offer, write what you sell, how it works, and the price. The AI uses this to explain your offer, and it will only ever quote the price you put here.

00:00:26.163 --> 00:00:36.703
In Ideal client, say who it is for, who is not a fit, and the questions you ask to find out. The AI asks them one at a time, the way a good setter would.

00:00:36.853 --> 00:00:48.802
Conversion goals are the places you send a lead. A booking page, a video, a webinar. Add each link, and say when it should be sent. The AI can only send links from this list.

00:00:48.952 --> 00:00:58.895
Voice and rules is how you write, the claims you are happy to make, and what must never be said. These are hard limits. The AI does not go outside them.

00:00:59.045 --> 00:01:05.469
Finish on Review, check it reads right, and save. From then on, every reply is written from this brief.
